"Press \"Wake\" to send Wake-on-LAN packet to turn the computer on if it supports this feature, press \"Retry\" to connect again.\n"
"\n"
"Try restart your computer if these doesn't work."
msgstr ""
"Drücke \"Aufwecken\", um den PC per Wake-on-LAN einzuschalten, sofern unterstützt, oder \"Erneut versuchen\", um dich neu zu verbinden.\n"
"\n"
"Falls das nicht hilft, starte den PC neu."

